# Spectra NGO — Domain Modules (revised)

## A — Unified procurement & stock

- One GRN can mix food, meds/vaccines, and staff retail on the same challan
- Lines: supplier, batch, expiry, qty, unit landed cost → batches + supplier AP
- Month-end: one payment clears supplier running tab
- All outwards (consumption, vaccine, staff POS) use **same FEFO**

## B — Dogs & medical

- Categories (spec): `ADULT_KENNEL`, `PUPPY_NURSERY`, `POST_OP_WARD`, `CRITICAL_ISOLATION`  
  Code today: `CareSection` `ADULT` / `JUVENILE` / `POST_OP` / `CRITICAL` — keep mapping; don’t fork
- Append-only notes; treatment/food outwards are request → manager issue → FEFO (₹0 clinical); managers may still issue food directly; next due + “due today” only after issue
- Census → theoretical feed (tenant grams/day); alert if food issue **>15%** vs theory

## C — Consumption & audits

- Multi-item MIN: food + meds in one voucher
- Cost centers (target): `KENNEL_FEEDING`, `CLINICAL_TREATMENT`, `EMERGENCY_RESCUE`
- Audit reasons (target): `SPOILAGE_ROTTEN`, `SPILLAGE_WASTAGE`, `UNACCOUNTED_LEAKAGE`, `BATCH_DAMAGE`
- States: `FLAGGED_UNCERTAIN` → `APPROVED_WRITE_OFF` | `REJECTED_AUDIT` (legacy: `REJECTED`)

## D — Staff POS (from unified stock)

- Tender: `PAYROLL_CREDIT` or Cash; credit guardrail vs unpaid dues + limit
- Passbook: receipts, lines, pending month balance
- No separate public external retail module unless explicitly added later

## E — Attendance / leave / LOP

- Leave: `PAID_CASUAL`, `PAID_SICK`, `UNPAID_LEAVE_LOP`, `HALF_DAY_LOP`
- Default: all working days are **present**. Do not mark daily attendance.
- Record **absences only**. Paid leave does not cut pay; LOP days × daily wage are deducted on payroll.

## F — Payroll

- Net = base − LOP − store dues − other
- States (target): `DRAFT` → `LOCKED` → `APPROVED` → `DISBURSED` (LOCKED not in code yet)
- On approve: POS → `DEDUCTED_IN_PAYROLL`; leaves → `PAYROLL_PROCESSED`
- Cap net at ₹0; rollover leftover store debt; printable itemized payslip

## G — Ops (optional extension)

- OpEx / fuel / dog-expense / analytics under `/api/ops` — keep branch-scoped
